cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below, and cite the associated article once published."
type: software
title: "Source-Grouped Evaluation of Temporal Stacking for Seismic Phase Picking with Three-Component Data"
version: "2026.09.15"
date-released: "2026-09-15"
abstract: >
  Source-grouped evaluation of temporal stacking on curated STEAD data.
  The submission_20260915 package contains the current 40-fit runner,
  frozen predictions, and portable analyses. Base seed is 42 and meta
  seeds are 42-44. Findings condition on one split and fixed bases.
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/rcw3712/ICNN_MetaPicker_Curated_STEAD_MATLAB"
